1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,560
Sometimes the best ideas come
when you give yourself space.

2
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:07,000
A single light can guide
you home through the dark,

3
00:00:07,425 --> 00:00:11,340
leave room on the page for the
things you have not imagined yet,

4
00:00:11,825 --> 00:00:15,080
and keep moving even when
the road ahead looks long.
